      en: ["Soest was first documented in a historical charter in the year 1028.", "The Soester Duinen is the largest active shifting sand area in Utrecht province.", "Soestdijk Palace was originally built in 1650 for the Mayor of Amsterdam.", "The local museum is housed in a beautifully preserved former convent building.", "The „De Windhond” windmill is a faithful reconstruction of a 1737 original.", "The National Military Museum of the Netherlands is located in the immediate vicinity."],
