      en: ["Heerenveen was officially founded on July 21, 1551.", "Thialf features the fastest lowland speed skating track in the world.", "SC Heerenveen was the first Frisian football club to play in the Champions League.", "The Crackstate is a monumental 1648 mansion now used as a wedding hall.", "Oranjewoud park served as the summer residence of the Stadtholders in the 17th century.", "Abe Lenstra, the stadium's namesake, is widely considered Frisia's greatest footballer."],
