      en: ["Vaassen was first mentioned in the year 891 in the Codex Laureshamensis.", "Cannenburch Castle was constructed in 1543 by field marshal Marten van Rossem.", "The village's Reformed Church contains funeral monuments from the 16th century.", "Local watermills are remnants of the historic paper and iron industries.", "Prehistoric agricultural systems known as 'Celtic Fields' are located nearby.", "The village is situated on the eastern edge of the Veluwe forest area."],
      es: ["Vaassen fue mencionada por primera vez en un documento en 1247.", "El castillo de Cannenburch fue construido en 1540.", "La población es de aproximadamente 10.000 habitantes.", "El molino de papel De Schoolmeester data del siglo XVII.", "Vaassen se encuentra a 5 km al oeste de Apeldoorn.", "El Veluwe se extiende sobre 1.100 km²."],
      pt: ["Vaassen foi mencionada pela primeira vez num documento em 1247.", "O castelo Cannenburch foi construído em 1540.", "A população é de cerca de 10.000 habitantes.", "O moinho de papel De Schoolmeester data do século XVII.", "Vaassen fica a 5 km a oeste de Apeldoorn.", "O Veluwe estende-se por 1.100 km²."],
      fr: ["Vaassen a été mentionnée pour la première fois dans un document en 1247.", "Le château de Cannenburch a été construit en 1540.", "Le nombre d'habitants est d'environ 10 000.", "Le moulin à papier De Schoolmeester date du XVIIe siècle.", "Vaassen se situe à 5 km à l'ouest d'Apeldoorn.", "La Veluwe s'étend sur plus de 1 100 km²."],
