      en: ["Granted city rights in 1275 by the Bishop of Utrecht.", "Global center for the production of artificial grass and carpets.", "Home to the 'Biezenmuseum', documenting the history of rush matting.", "Located at the confluence of the river Zwarte Water and the Zwarte Meer.", "Much of the town was destroyed in a major fire in 1868.", "A significant center for the Reformed Church in the Netherlands."],
