      en: ["Center of the historic Land van Maas en Waal region", "Major site for the brick industry until the 20th century", "St. Ewaldenkerk was designed by architect Carl Weber", "Located directly on the banks of the river Waal", "First written record dates back to 1145", "Population is approximately 19,000 residents"],
